<title>POLAND: Bank Gdanski Q3 net falls to PLN 28.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Bank Gdanski Q3 net falls to PLN 28.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
